m1	130,1000,1675,1240		Treble clef; three bars of reciting notes on one pitch, each bar closing on a different cadence, set to "Sic canta comma, sic duo puncta: sic vero punctum" / "Thus sing the comma, and thus the colon: and thus the full stop": the Münster lesson formulae.
m2	370,1263,1430,1503		Treble clef; one bar of reciting notes on one pitch ending in a rising turn, set to "Sic signum interrogationis?" / "Thus sing the mark of interrogation?": the Münster formula for a question.
